prefix detroit https://detroitmi.gov/zoning/

class DecisionMakingBody
class BoardDecision
class MatterKind

individual DetroitBZA types DecisionMakingBody
individual ReverseOrAdjustAdministrativeAction types MatterKind
individual ApplicantFavorableMatter types MatterKind
individual Variance types MatterKind
individual HardshipReliefUseVariance types MatterKind

property decision_by domain BoardDecision range DecisionMakingBody min 1 max 1
property matter_kind domain BoardDecision range MatterKind min 1
property specializes domain MatterKind range MatterKind
datatype authorized_members domain DecisionMakingBody range nonNegativeInteger min 1 max 1
datatype concurring_votes domain BoardDecision range nonNegativeInteger min 1 max 1

fact specializes HardshipReliefUseVariance Variance
